            <!-- Focus ring: a single reusable, non-focusable overlay that
                 lib/color_picker.py repositions/resizes onto whichever control
                 currently has focus (see ColorPickerDialog._update_focus_ring).
                 Declared last so it paints on top of every swatch/field/button.
                 texturefocus/texturenofocus on every button share one texture
                 and colordiffuse, so a focused grid swatch is otherwise pixel-
                 identical to an unfocused one; with no ring, keyboard/remote
